msgstr "@proto2 […]"

msgid "@proto2b [Thank you for everything, Niko.]"
msgstr "@proto2b [今までありがとう、ニコ。]"

msgid "@niko_speak So... do you like being a robot?"
msgstr ""
"@niko_speak あの…プロトって、\n"
"ロボットの姿が好きなの？"

msgid "@proto1 [Um.]"
msgstr "@proto1 [ええと。]"

msgid "@proto2 [Why this, all of a sudden?]"
msgstr "@proto2 [何故、それを急に？]"

msgid "@niko2 Well, I'm gonna leave soon, so I just wanted to ask one more question!"
msgstr ""
"@niko2 えっと、ミーはもうすぐ行っちゃうから、\n"
"何か1つ聞いておきたくて！"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed There aren't many robots in my home world..."
msgstr ""
"@niko_eyeclosed ミーがいた世界には、ロボットは\n"
"あんまりいないから…"

msgid "@proto2 [Ah.]"
msgstr "@proto2 [ああ。]"

msgid "@proto2b [It's... nice.]"
msgstr "@proto2b [まあ…悪くないよ。]"

msgid "@cedric_smile I suppose it's alright!"
msgstr "@cedric_smile なかなかのものですよ！"

msgid "@rue_smile Haha, that's a tough question, Niko!"
msgstr "@rue_smile ふふ。なかなか難しい質問ね、ニコ！"

msgid "@rue_smile I mean...\\.\\. do you like being a person?"
msgstr "@rue_smile じゃあ…\\.\\.あなたは、人の姿は好き？"

msgid "@niko_speak Of course!"
msgstr "@niko_speak うん！"

msgid "@niko2 ..."
msgstr "@niko2 …"

msgid "@niko_what Wait.\\>\\nWhy did you two answer my robot question too?"
msgstr ""
"@niko_what ねえ。\\>\\nどうして2人とも、ミーのロボットの\n"
"質問に答えたの？"

msgid "@cedric2 ..."
msgstr "@cedric2 … "

msgid "@rue_talk ..."
msgstr "@rue_talk …"

msgid "@rue_smile Don't worry about it!"
msgstr "@rue_smile どうしてかしら、不思議ね！"

msgid "@proto2 [...In the end, the World Machine was starting to create its own code.]"
msgstr ""
"@proto2 […結局、ワールドマシンは\n"
"自身のコードを作成し始めてた。]"

msgid "@proto1c [Going above and beyond its programming, not as the result of error, but as a conscious choice on the part of the machine...]"
msgstr ""
"@proto1c [エラーの結果ではなく、機械としての意識的な\n"
"選択によって、自身のプログラムを超越した…]"

msgid "@proto1b [...Being able to generate its own path forward.]"
msgstr "@proto1b […自身の進むべき道を、生成することができた。]"

msgid "@proto2b [That's...\\.\\. what being tamed is all about.]"
msgstr "@proto2b [制御化とは…\\.\\. そういうこと。]"

msgid "@cedric_smile I couldn't have said it better myself."
msgstr "@cedric_smile 文句なしの説明ですね。"

